From 5213f9ecfc5429170502848cf8f92aed0607134b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Repo Modularization <assistant@example.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 18:49:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Split large files into modular units (hooks, section
 components, feature services)

- Extract shared JWT/Cognito auth into lib/api-auth.ts (requireCognitoAuth,
  requireAdminAuth), removing duplicated token-parsing logic from 7 API
  route files.
- Extract Prisma logic for teacher onboarding Step 1 and Step 2 into
  features/teacher/server/{step1,step2}.service.ts. Step 2's create/update
  field-mapping is now a single shared function instead of two copies.
- Slim down API routes to auth -> parse -> call service -> respond:
    api/teacher/onboarding/step1/route.ts
    api/teacher/onboarding/step2/route.ts
    api/teacher/onboarding/status/route.ts
    api/teacher/profile/route.ts
    api/admin/teachers/route.ts
    api/admin/teachers/[teacherId]/approval/route.ts
- Split app/teacher/onboarding/step2/page.tsx (849 lines) into
  useTeacherStep2Form hook + 5 section components under
  features/teacher/components/onboarding/step2/.
- Split app/teacher/onboarding/step1/page.tsx into useTeacherStep1Form hook,
  page now just composes existing subcomponents.
- Split app/admin/teachers/page.tsx (588 lines) into useTeachersList hook,
  TeacherApprovalCard + 3 section components, and shared Section/InfoField
  primitives under features/admin/.
- Update ARCHITECTURE.md with the hook+sections / service+thin-route
  pattern to follow for future large files, and flag remaining candidates
  (TeacherSidebar/Navbar, step3 page, empty TeacherPersonalInfo.tsx).

No behavior changes: verified with tsc --noEmit against the same 2
pre-existing Prisma-client-generation errors as before this change (0 new
errors introduced).
